{"id":"wb-8-427","name":"龙藏寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"龍藏寺","text":"龙藏寺，旧名慈惠庵，是位于四川省成都市新都区新繁街道荣军路86号的明清时期古建筑，现被用作四川省革命伤残军人休养院。2019年，龙藏寺入选第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BE%8D%E8%97%8F%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":93147878,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93147878","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/a068620b4ae067dd195e6fee.jpg","title":"龙藏寺-六角亭_2025-06-09_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%BE%99%E8%97%8F%E5%AF%BA-%E5%85%AD%E8%A7%92%E4%BA%AD_2025-06-09_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fb/%E9%BE%99%E8%97%8F%E5%AF%BA-%E5%85%AD%E8%A7%92%E4%BA%AD_2025-06-09_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Kcx36","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​龙藏寺-六角亭","width":320,"height":213}}